Please find the Q1 2023 inspection status for the ATU-100. Current activities are being managed according to the RBI intervals defined in QSCP-IP-ATU100 Rev 3, which specifies 3 years for Class 1 sour gas, regenerator overhead, and rich amine, and 6 years for all other lines.

Regarding the 3-year RBI survey detailed in LNDE-RPT-20220906-033-R0, please note that CMLs 4-RA-101-06 and 6-RA-103-11 were recorded as inaccessible due to lack of scaffolding. These points have been carried forward to the 2024 survey.

